Association EducationOrganizationNetworkAssociation
    documentation 'Properties of the association between the EducationOrganization and its 
                  'network(s).
    domain entity EducationOrganizationNetwork
        documentation 'A reference to the EducationOrganizationNetwork to which this education organization is a member.
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation 'The EducationOrganization member in the network.
        with context Member
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'The date on which the EducationOrganization joined this network.
        is optional
    date EndDate
        documentation 'The date on which the EducationOrganization left this network.
        is optional